Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Disabling this breaks Feedback Hub and Get-WindowsUpdateLog (can't diagnose Windows
; Update failures after the fact). Security updates and Defender are unaffected.
; Kept disabled deliberately: it's the strongest telemetry cut available, and unlike
; AllowTelemetry it isn't clamped on Pro/Home (see Disable_Telemetry.reg).
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\DiagTrack]
"Start"=dword:00000004

; Disabling this breaks MDM/Intune enrollment.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\dmwappushservice]
"Start"=dword:00000004
